\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl276\slmult1\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Me Nyame, ade  ase yi,
\par meda  'se w] nn[ nhyira ho.
\par Me Hene pa, dom fa me hy[
\par wo  ntaban dennen no ase.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Me b]ne a may[ won n[,
\par wo D]ba no nti, fa firi.
\par S[ meda anadwo yi a,
\par ma  minnya wo mu asomdwoe.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Kyer[ me na ma minhu s[
\par me mp ate s[ me damoa.
\par Kyer[ me na ma minhu s[
\par mewu  na mas]re bio.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Wo mu na me kra b[home,
\par na manya nna pa mu home,
\par ]home mu aho]den
\par De anyan asom me Nyame.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. S[ m'ani sare dwe mpo a,
\par ma minnwen soro ade ho.
\par Siw adaeso b]ne ho kwan,
\par na mma sum mu b]ne nnka me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Monkamfo Nyame, n'ad]e nti,
\par Fam ab]de, munyi n' ay[.
\par Soro asafo kuw nso no,
\par Agya, \}ban ne Honhom, no.\f1\fs22 
